# Silithus - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Silithus accept in the local census (52 quests, band 54-60,
# docs/silithus-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 52 turnins
# close every record that has one in the data (all 52 do). The 35 event-gated
# records (AQ gate cluster ev85/86, hive phases ev62/63/64, Lunar Festival
# ev7), the 18 repeatables and the 9 Horde set-asides are out with reasons in
# the census. No race header; the three Alliance-only quests (9415/9419 inline,
# 8376 composed with its class gate) and the 8275 mini ride only Alliance gates
# per docs/faction-ungating.md. Class
# gates: the 7 contracted Armaments of War variants ride only-gated per line
# (Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Rogue, Priest, Mage+Warlock, Druid; the Shaman
# twin is Horde and set aside). Profession lines ride optional + when-skill
# Cooking (8307/8313/8317). Soft pres ride dedicated when-onquest minis: 8275
# (Ironforge accept), 1124 (Moonglade accept), 8279 (event-gated Twilight
# Lexicon), 8305 (Tanaris accept). The Horde twin 8276 is a structural note.
# Objectives with no data placement ship as honest note-only namings (BWL head
# 8288, MC mats + crafted bars 7786, satchel 8282, rubbings 8309) or gate
# completes (ZG venom 9023); crafted turn-ins ride the R5 handling.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silithus
title Silithus
levels 54-60
zone Silithus
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Cenarion Hold arrival - the Bluewall report

  zone map 1451

  tip Cenarion Hold is the hub: flight point, inn and most givers below. This opening leg rides west to the Bluewall post and back.
  accept 9415 only Alliance -- Report to Marshal Bluewall - Rifleman Torrig (50.68, 34.71); a min-level-1 breadcrumb below the band, routed here as the zone entry
  turnin 9415 only Alliance -- Report to Marshal Bluewall - to Marshal Bluewall (33.29, 51.06)
  accept 9419 only Alliance -- Scouring the Desert - Marshal Bluewall; the dust doodad beside him
  complete 9419 only Alliance @32.95,50.81 -- the Silithus Dust turnin doodad
  turnin 9419 only Alliance -- Scouring the Desert - back to Marshal Bluewall

