  complete 8277 @50.46,16.76 -- Sand Skitterer fangs off the skitterers
  turnin 8277 -- Deadly Desert Venom - back to Beetix Ficklespragg
  accept 8278 -- Noggle's Last Hope - Beetix Ficklespragg; flayers and rock stalkers south, pincers nearer
