  complete 8278 @28.53,43.23 -- Stonelash Pincer stingers off the pincers
  complete 8278 @27.22,75.26 -- Rock Stalker fangs in the south
  turnin 8278 -- Noggle's Last Hope - back to Beetix Ficklespragg
  accept 8282 -- Noggle's Lost Satchel - Noggle Ficklespragg (51.63, 38.5); the satchel has no placed spawn in the data - check the hives and crannies, then turn in here
  turnin 8282 -- Noggle's Lost Satchel - back to Noggle Ficklespragg

