  note Williden's Journal (3884) starts from A Mangled Journal off the Frenzied Pterrordax - rare eastern spawn (79, 43.2) and (80, 62.7). Take it if it drops, hand it to Williden Marshal in Un'Goro on the expedition leg below; the route never waits on it.
